"rowA\">\n<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"kick\">Theme · 主线题材命门 · 第3路 · 截至 07-15</div><h1>医药【放宽】+320%宽而不硬:发酵Day1未证,只做业绩锚</h1><p>6有聚类口径;三级判定与生命周期引_题材四维.json;题材归属对齐12号归位唯一真源。</p><div class=\"stance\"><span class=\"pill \">主流 · <b class=\"s-mid\">医药6/6·21只</b></span><span class=\"pill warn\">警报 · <b class=\"\">AI-50%/油煤-67%缩</b></span><span class=\"pill warn\">身位 · <b class=\"\">业绩锚>接力</b></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"top\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2-7 4 14 2-7h6\"/></svg></span><span class=\"chip2 c-hit\">6/6主流</span></div><span class=\"lab\">主流候选宽度</span><span class=\"big\"><span data-v=\"21\">21</span><small>只</small></span><span class=\"sub2\">医药/创新药(一字2·最高4板)</span></div><div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"top\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 4l6 7h-4v9h-4v-9H6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"chip2 c-miss\">AI-50%/油煤-67%</span></div><span class=\"lab\">缩圈警报</span><span class=\"big\"><span class=\"big\" style=\"font-size:20px\">2线收缩</span></span><span class=\"sub2\">AI算力5/6环比-50%·油气煤炭-67%</span></div><div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"top\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 19h16M6 19V9m6 10V4m6 15v-7\"/></svg></span><span class=\"chip2 c-half\">新线3</span></div><span class=\"lab\">新线数</span><span class=\"big\"><span data-v=\"3\">3</span><small>条</small></span><span class=\"sub2\">中报预增/困境反转·消费·重组各首板</span></div><div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"top\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3v10.3a4 4 0 1 0 2 0V3z\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"17\" r=\"1.6\"/></svg></span><span class=\"chip2 c-mut\">T+1价源null</span></div><span class=\"lab\">昨题材结算</span><span class=\"big\"><span class=\"big\" style=\"font-size:20px\">null</span></span><span class=\"sub2\">0714题材Top执行口径网络不可达</span></div>\n</div>\n<h2>一 荐票卡</h2>\n<div class=\"obs\"><div class=\"obs-head\"><span class=\"obs-nm\">迪哲医药-U</span><span class=\"mut\">688192</span><span class=\"obs-pos 